#. な、なんだよ、この部屋…！？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh-What the hell is this...!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>一目でわかる異様さ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The grotesque horror of the room struck me hard and\n"
"fast.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、異様なのは、
#. 目に映る光景だけじゃなかった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What I saw was bad enough, but what I smelled...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>教室の中に漂う…強烈で不快な匂い…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was sour, pungent, impossibly rank...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 酷い匂いだな…
msgctxt "0005 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "It smells awful, doesn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. こ、この匂いって…？
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I-It's..."
msgstr ""

#. 薄々、勘付いているはずだ。
#. ここで何度も“人の死”に立ち会ってきたお前ならな…
msgctxt "0007 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It must be at least vaguely familiar to you. After\n"
"all, you've been around your fair share of corpses."
msgstr ""

#. もしかして、これって…
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Are you saying...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>死の匂い<CLT>…
#. 人間の<CLT 3>血<CLT>と<CLT 3>脂<CLT>の匂いだ…
msgctxt "0009 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It's the <CLT 3>smell of death<CLT>. Their <CLT 3>flesh<CLT> and <CLT 3>fat<CLT> and\n"
"<CLT 3>blood<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…不思議と驚きはなかった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There was no surprise in his voice, no shock.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>十神クンの言う通りだ。
#. ボクは、この匂いを何度も経験していた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But he was right. I had experienced this smell more\n"
"than once before...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは……<CLT><CLT 3>死と絶望の匂い<CLT><CLT 4>…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was the smell of <CLT><CLT 3>death and despair<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. だが、それにしても強烈だ。
#. 血と脂の匂いが凝縮され…まるで戦場のようだ。
msgctxt "0013 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But the smell here is strong, condensed. It's the\n"
"smell of a battlefield."
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり…これもモノクマが…
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Monokuma must have—"
msgstr ""

#. またボクのせいですか！？
msgctxt "0015 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "What, my fault AGAIN!?"
msgstr ""

#. そうやって、なんでもかんでも、
#. ボクのせいにしないでよねッ！！
msgctxt "0016 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Stop trying to blame everything on me!"
msgstr ""

#. お、お前が何もしていないなら…
#. こんな事になっているはずないだろ…！
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I-If you hadn't done what you did, this never would\n"
"have happened!"
msgstr ""

#. いやいや…むしろ逆なんですけど…
msgctxt "0018 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "No, no, no. It's quite the opposite!"
msgstr ""

#. …逆？
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The opposite...?"
msgstr ""

#. えー、ヒントを教えましょう。
msgctxt "0020 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Yup! Let me give you an itty bitty eegie squeegie\n"
"little hint."
msgstr ""

#. この部屋に関しては、
#. 本当に何もしていませんよ。
msgctxt "0021 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "As far as this room goes, I don't know a thing!"
msgstr ""

#. 掃除もしないで、
#. <CLT 3>当時の状況にしておいた<CLT>だけなのです！
msgctxt "0022 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I just <CLT 3>left it exactly how I found it<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr "Cái gì...?"

#. 以上、意地悪なＲＰＧのヒントよりも、
#. ほんの少しだけマシって程度のヒントでした！
msgctxt "0024 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"How's that for a hint!? Better than those stupid\n"
"\"hints\" you get from NPCs in those mean old RPGs!"
msgstr ""

#. それにしても、
#. 血だらけなんて物騒だよね。
msgctxt "0025 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"But it's pretty scary, huh? Blood all over the walls\n"
"and junk..."
msgstr ""

#. でもさ、外の世界でも、
#. 人って毎日死んでるんだし…
msgctxt "0026 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Of course, even in the outside world, people die\n"
"bloody, gruesome deaths every day!"
msgstr ""

#. だから、大した事じゃないさ！
#. 上を向いて歩こうぜッ！！
msgctxt "0027 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"So it's not really a big deal! Just keep your chin up\n"
"and keep on livin', soldier!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あいつ、何を言ってるんだ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What's he talking about...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>掃除もしないで当時の状況にしておいただけ、とか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He just left it the way he found it?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それって…どういう意味だよ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What's the meaning of all this...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 十神クン…
#. さっきのモノクマの言葉だけどさ…
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Um, Byakuya? About what Monokuma just told us..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0032 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>こっちを見向きもしない。
#. 何かを考え込んでるみたいだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's like I'm not even here. He must be lost in\n"
"thought.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>集中している…？
#. いや、ボクを無視しているだけかも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is he really thinking that hard? Or is he just\n"
"flat-out ignoring me...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0035 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0036 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Không"

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>まだ気になる所がある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't think I've seen everything there is to see...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>教室中に血痕が飛び散っている…
#. まさに、目を覆いたくなる惨状ってヤツだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's blood all over the place. I want to shut my\n"
"eyes forever against such a ghastly sight...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Máu vương vãi khắp mọi nơi. Mình chỉ muốn nhắm mắt lại mãi mãi\n"
"để không phải nhìn thấy một cảnh tượng rùng rợn như thế này...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. …血痕はすっかり乾いているようだ。
msgctxt "0040 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "It appears all the bloodstains are dry."
msgstr ""

#. それに、変色の具合からして、
#. この血痕は、<CLT 3>かなり古い物<CLT>のようだな。
msgctxt "0041 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"And their color has changed, as well. I think it's\n"
"safe to assume these stains are <CLT 3>considerably old<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. これって全部…本物の血なのかな？
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "This is all...really blood?"
msgstr ""

#. 当然だ。そうでなければ面白くないだろう。
msgctxt "0043 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Of course. I wouldn't find it interesting otherwise."
msgstr ""

#. まったく興味深いな…
#. 一体、この教室で何が起きたんだろうな…？
msgctxt "0044 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"And it *is* interesting, I assure you. What on Earth\n"
"happened in this classroom...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まるで楽しんでいるみたいだ…
#. やっぱり、十神クンには付いていけないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He seems like he's...enjoying himself. No way can I\n"
"\"keep up\" with someone like that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>床に直接書かれた白線…
#. 人型になぞられた不気味な白線だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are white chalk outlines drawn all over the\n"
"floor. How many bodies were there...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có những đường phấn trắng vẽ hình người được phác trên khắp sàn\n"
"nhà. Đã có bao nhiêu cái xác ở đây vậy chứ...?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>こういうのって見た事あるよな…
#. テレビの刑事ドラマとかの…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I've seen this kind of thing on detective shows and\n"
"stuff like that.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Mình từng thấy những thứ như thế này trên mấy bộ phim truyền\n"
"hình về thám tử và mấy thứ như vậy.\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>…<CLT><CLT 3>死体発見現場<CLT><CLT 4>とかで。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You always see it at the <CLT><CLT 3>scene of a murder<CLT><CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>まさかな……と思いたい。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I wish I could say I don't believe it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0051 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0052 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Không"

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0053 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>まだ気になる所がある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't think I've seen everything there is to see...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
